49-waiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p032","quote":"李夫人蚤卒，其兄李延年以音幸，號協律。協律者，故倡也。兄弟皆坐姦，族。是時其長兄廣利為貳師將軍，伐大宛，不及誅，還，而上既夷李氏，後憐其家，乃封為海西侯。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0040"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p017","quote":"數歳，天漢二年秋，貳師將軍李廣利將三萬騎擊匈奴右賢王於祁連天山，而使陵將其射士歩兵五千人出居延北可千餘里，欲以分匈奴兵，毋令專走貳師也。陵既至期還，而單于以兵八萬圍擊陵軍。陵軍五千人，兵矢既盡，士死者過半，而所殺傷匈奴亦萬餘人。且引且戰，連鬬八日，還未到居延百餘里，匈奴遮狹絶道，陵食乏而救兵不到，虜急擊招降陵。陵曰：「無面目報陛下。」遂降匈奴。其兵盡沒，餘亡散得歸漢者四百餘人。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0009","c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0013","c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0064"]}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》伐宛將軍與還後全名","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"乃拜李夫人兄廣利為貳師將軍","scope":"same_campaign_family_context","image_verified":false},{"title":"《資治通鑑》還軍封侯全名","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"封李廣利為海西侯","scope":"same_campaign_full_name_context","image_verified":false}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p032","text":"李夫人蚤卒，其兄李延年以音幸，號協律。協律者，故倡也。兄弟皆坐姦，族。是時其長兄廣利為貳師將軍，伐大宛，不及誅，還，而上既夷李氏，後憐其家，乃封為海西侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"李夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"52o_i25_ekg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"李延年","kind":"person","person_id":"600_7ih_3xk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"兄弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"廣利","kind":"person","person_id":"yzg_zju_tse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m032-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p017","text":"數歳，天漢二年秋，貳師將軍李廣利將三萬騎擊匈奴右賢王於祁連天山，而使陵將其射士歩兵五千人出居延北可千餘里，欲以分匈奴兵，毋令專走貳師也。陵既至期還，而單于以兵八萬圍擊陵軍。陵軍五千人，兵矢既盡，士死者過半，而所殺傷匈奴亦萬餘人。且引且戰，連鬬八日，還未到居延百餘里，匈奴遮狹絶道，陵食乏而救兵不到，虜急擊招降陵。陵曰：「無面目報陛下。」遂降匈奴。其兵盡沒，餘亡散得歸漢者四百餘人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"貳師將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"李廣利","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"右賢王","kind":"person","person_id":"r03_tsm_2cn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"fyv_cvv_y5b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"x9i_8zv_ker","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m017-0140","start":140,"end":141,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"wdz_85c_o7f","status":"contextua